            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CanDoNan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good enough for company! So many things come out of slow cooker tasting over boiled or tortured, not this time! The barley was toothsome, the mushrooms earthy and lush. I did not have the time to cook for one hour and then remove the portobellos, I cut them into pieces and chucked them in. Hi oh hi ho. Mother-in-law for dinner 8 hours later and this dish made me look like a chef. I will be making this regularly."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "WiseDill5979"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good as written. I was amazed by the reviews so far. I followed it, did not add anything else or different, and it came out perfect. Makes a ton of soup! Will have this again.",
            "datePublished": "2022-09-13T23:28:40.176Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Patty Wiley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this recipe using different mushrooms because that's what I had on hand and needed to use up. I used shitakes, baby bellas, and chickens of the woods. I made it vegetarian by using vegetable boullion rather than beef broth. It was delicious and I'll definitely make it again, perhaps trying other varieties of shrooms.",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-06T02:31:30.130Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sheila"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Never again! I should have realized that four stars with only two reviews told a tale! Our family loves mushrooms and barley so I made a double batch to share with my sister and brother and their families! I still can't figure out how all those flavor- filled ingredients could result in such lackluster flavor. I tried to doctor it up with pink Himalayan salt and fresh ground pepper....nope! Worcestershire sauce.....nope! There was no saving this mushroom soup!",
            "datePublished": "2016-01-13T18:59:54.710Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Stephanie BowerCraft"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The soup's consistency is great, nice and hearty although the flavor is very mild. Unfortunately my family learned we don't like all the different mushrooms so I might be leaving out some of the variety next time.",
